'''Forbidden Compound''' (禁断の調合, ''Kindan no Chōgō'', '''Forbidden Formulation''') is a 1-slot [[Cat Combo]]. It was added in [[Version 11.8 Update|Version 11.8]].

==Effect==
Cat Cannon Recharge UP (Sm): Cat Cannon will charge 10 seconds faster.

